The `eext/` directory of this repository, when present, contains a MODIFIED
version of that extension. Modifications are listed in eext/CHANGES.md as
required by Apache License 2.0 section 4(b). The upstream LICENSE is retained
in that directory.

Everything else in this repository is original work:

  * The MCP server (src/eda-mcp-server.mjs) is an independent implementation.
    It calls the EasyEDA Pro scripting API; calling an API does not make a
    program a derivative work of that API's implementation.
  * The WebSocket server (src/ws-server.mjs) implements RFC 6455 from the
    specification.
  * The bridge (src/bridge-embedded.mjs) implements the gateway's wire protocol,
    which is defined by the extension in eext/ (Apache-2.0, above).
  * The analysis scripts (src/sch-netlist.mjs, src/sch-netcheck.mjs,
    src/pcb-dfm-check.mjs, src/capture-canvas.mjs) are original.

The optional autorouter tool (src/freerouting-mcp-server.mjs) INVOKES Freerouting
